er difficulty understanding it  not that we can blame her things get  pretty complicated when steve has to  explain the legal concept of a marriage  that's permanent  until it isn't for instance then why do  they do it  i have no idea if marriage is that  difficult to understand though  it stands to reason that she's going to  have a hard time with the rest of the  world  diana stays in our world after the  events of the movie which means  she suddenly has to learn about  everything from banking to home  ownership  imagine the conversation that ensues the  first time someone has to explain  bankruptcy or parking tickets to her of  course if the film stopped to  acknowledge every single explanation  that steve and etta had to offer  ares probably would have conquered the  world without much trouble there are a  few other examples that are pretty  notable however  what's that it's a uh  oh on the boat from themyscira diana  makes it clear that she has an  understanding of reproduction but is  puzzled by the sight of a couple holding  hands  the mysqra is rich in art and culture  but diana doesn't seem to understand the  purpose of clothes that exist for  anything other than fighting  she views ice cream as a true miracle  yet has no trouble with the concept of a  camera bullets and bracelets  it's established pretty early on that  wonder woman has powers other amazon  warriors do not  and by the end of the movie we know why  diana isn't just an amazon she's a  demigod the daughter of zeus and  hippolyta giving her powers far beyond  the warrior prowess of a typical amazon  these powers apparently include jumping  to incredible heights supernatural  toughness and super strength  we see her do things like walking out of  a collapsing tower unscathed  and tossing around armored vehicles on  more than one occasion yet whenever  anyone fires a gun at her  she deflects it either with her  bracelets or with her shield if diana  can walk away from being tossed around  by the 